1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:03,520
(Bernadette:)Sexually.

2
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:05,260
(Raj:)Got it. Take care.

3
00:00:06,790 --> 00:00:07,990
(Raj:)I guess I have no choice

4
00:00:07,990 --> 00:00:09,760
(Raj:)but to make sweet,
guilt-free love to you

5
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:11,980
(Raj:)over and over again
for the rest of my life.

6
00:00:11,980 --> 00:00:14,100
(Bernadette:)That's how I heard it.

7
00:00:20,970 --> 00:00:22,210
Or it could be "sy-fee."

8
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:23,410
(Sheldon:)What?

9
00:00:23,410 --> 00:00:26,110
S-y-F-y. "Sy-fee."

10
00:00:26,110 --> 00:00:27,710
(Raj:)Oh, right.

11
00:00:27,710 --> 00:00:29,910
(Raj:)Good one.

12
00:00:32,350 --> 00:00:34,490
(Penny:)So, did you get a chance
to go over the scene I gave you?

13
00:00:34,490 --> 00:00:36,670
(Sheldon:)Yes. I didn't care for it.

14
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:42,630
Okay, Cat on a Hot Tin Roof
is an American classic.

15
00:00:42,630 --> 00:00:43,900
(Sheldon:)So is the McRib sandwich.

16
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:45,960
(Sheldon:)I don't care
for that, either.

17
00:00:48,470 --> 00:00:51,800
(Penny:)Fine. What would you rather do
as a scene study?

18
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:53,440
(Sheldon:)I'm glad you asked.

19
00:00:53,440 --> 00:00:54,670
(Sheldon:)I took the liberty

20
00:00:54,670 --> 00:00:57,610
of adapting a Star Trek
fan fiction novella

21
00:00:57,610 --> 00:00:59,140
(Sheldon:)I wrote when I was ten

